Content and third-party material

The MIT license above covers the source code. It doesn't cover the content and
media below, which you may not copy or redistribute on its terms.

All rights reserved:

- The OpenArabic name and mark, and the images made from them: assets/images/
  (except assets/images/articles/), brand/, store-listing/,
  social/assets/oaLogo.png, and admin-dashboard/public/oaLogo.png and og.png.
- The interface sound in assets/sounds/.
- The social card and screenshots in .github/readme/, and the screenshots in
  admin-dashboard/public/screenshots/ and docs/qa/.
- Translations and generated texts: the English texts in translate/0_inbox_en/,
  the al-Fawāʾid translation in translate/data/fawaid/output/ and
  admin-dashboard/public/books/al-fawaid.pdf, the dictionary entries in
  admin-dashboard/lib/word-enrichment.ts, and the words and glosses in
  social/*.json. The app's articles, translations and audio live in its
  database, not here, under the terms shown in the app.

Third-party material keeps its own terms:

- Arabic texts of the classical works keep the terms of the edition they were
  taken from. translate/data/fawaid/fawaid_full.txt is the Dār al-Kutub
  al-ʿIlmiyya edition of al-Fawāʾid (Beirut, 1973) as published on turath.io;
  the Arabic sentences in __tests__/fixtures/ come from the app's texts.
- The English Qurʾān verses quoted in the al-Fawāʾid translation are the
  Saheeh International translation.
- The article photographs in assets/images/articles/ and
  translate/data/images/ are licensed from stock libraries, among them
  Shutterstock, Pexels, Unsplash and Pixabay. Those licences don't extend to
  you.
- The App Store and Google Play badges in admin-dashboard/public/badges/ are
  Apple's and Google's.
- Fonts under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org):
  Amiri, Inter, DigitalKhatt New Madina, Noto Nastaliq Urdu, Noto Sans Arabic
  and Scheherazade New in assets/fonts/, social/assets/fonts/ and
  admin-dashboard/public/fonts/, and Amiri and EB Garamond in
  translate/data/fawaid/fonts/.
